# Security headers (added 2026-10-04, student-privacy audit)
# No CSP yet on purpose; no X-Frame-Options so nothing that embeds this site breaks.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
  Permissions-Policy: microphone=(self), midi=(self), camera=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=(), interest-cohort=()
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
